  <section id="about">
    <h2>About this website</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="mt0">The Harvington Website and Newsletter are independent. They're run by a local volunteer, not by the parish councils, the village halls or any other organisation.</p>
      <p><strong>It's free.</strong> Reading the site, getting the newsletter and listing an event, notice, club or local business all cost nothing.</p>
      <p><strong>How listings are checked.</strong> Events and notices come from local groups, organisers and residents, and from council and community websites. Each one is read and checked before it goes up, and we ask the organiser if anything is unclear. Once a year we ask each group and business we list to check its entry.</p>
      <p><strong>Official notices.</strong> When a parish council or other official body sends us a statement, we publish it in their own words, fixing only obvious typos.</p>
      <p class="mb0"><strong>Corrections.</strong> If something is wrong or out of date, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> and we'll put it right.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

